judgment.rationale:
The only available evidence collector — getModelCard — returned null, indicating that no model card exists for "churn-predictor-v1" / "churn-predictor-endpoint". 

Control RA-3.v2 requires a substantive risk assessment that covers:
(a) Identification of threats and vulnerabilities, likelihood and magnitude of harm, and PII-related adverse effects on individuals;
(b) Integration of risk assessment results with organizational and mission/business-process risk management decisions;
(c) Recording of risk assessment results in a security/privacy plan, risk assessment report, or equivalent document;
(d) Periodic review of risk assessment results;
(e) Dissemination of results to defined personnel/roles; and
(f) Updating the risk assessment on a defined frequency or upon significant changes.

Without a model card or any equivalent risk documentation, there is no evidence that any of these sub-requirements have been addressed. The absence of a model card means there is no recorded risk assessment, no documented threat/vulnerability analysis, no likelihood or impact determinations, no PII-impact analysis, no review cadence, no dissemination plan, and no update schedule. All six sub-requirements of RA-3 are therefore unmet.
